        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>NGP 16A-52, 2-1/2 x 52 Rain Drip Guard</b>\r\n<p>\r\n2-1/2\" projection x 52\" length aluminum rain drip guard. These drip guards are made from non rusting T5 aluminum alloy and used on exterior doors to prevent rain water from dripping into the door top. They screw onto the top of the door frame or above the frame. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAnodized clear finish Aluminum.  Packaged with #6 x 3/4\" stainless steel SMS. Screw holes slotted for easy adjustment. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available  <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-36-rain-drip-guard-ngp-16a-36\"><b>36\" Door Drip Guard</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-40-rain-drip-guard-ngp-16a-40\"><b>40\" Door Drip Guard</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-48-rain-drip-guard-ngp-16a-48\"><b>48\" Door Drip Guard</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-72-rain-drip-guard-ngp-16a-72\"><b>72\" Door Drip Guard</b></a>  and  <a href=\"/products/2-1-2-x-76-rain-drip-guard-ngp-16a-76\"><b>76\" Door Drip Guard</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for NGP 16A-52 52\" Drip Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 52\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: T5 aluminum alloy</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Anodized Clear Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Installation Screws: 6 x 3/4\" stainless steel SMS Screws</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
